{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is no princess to save, nor dragon to slay. You are, Just a Ball.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a surreal, momentum-driven 3D platformer where movement feels like a dream. In a stylized, abstract world suspended in the sky and submerged in deep water, you control a ball with a suite of satisfying, gravity-defying abilities. Roll, sprint, dash, and unleash a powerful downward thrust to master the air and stick your landings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: find a lost spark of light to unlock the portal to the next challenge. Guided by a unique layered music system that swells and builds as you draw closer to your objective, the journey is a purely sensory experience. <i>Just Balls</i> is built on a single core principle: movement that feels inherently good. With forgiving level design that catches you when you fall, and physics that invite you to experiment, it\u2019s a game designed to put you into a pure state of flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/4981149ad092aea0550daf6c498e248c.poster.avif?t=1771595233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/4981149ad092aea0550daf6c498e248c.webm?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/4981149ad092aea0550daf6c498e248c.mp4?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Flow:</strong> Chain together sprints, mid-air dashes, and gravity-boosting slams. The physics are fine-tuned for aerial freedom, satisfying hang-time, and smooth momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Surreal Sandbox:</strong> Explore dozens of handcrafted, abstract levels across distinct worlds\u2014from serene floating architecture to complex underwater mazes featuring custom buoyancy and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgiving Platforming:</strong> Missed a jump? There are no punishing game-overs. The world is built with safety nets and lower platforms to catch your fall, allowing you to dust yourself off and launch right back into the sky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Layered Audio Guide:</strong> Let the music lead the way. An interactive, dynamic soundtrack builds in intensity as you draw closer to your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Elements:</strong> Launch off bounce pads, ride massive ramps for speed, float upward on streams of bubbles, and navigate moving platforms at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo Mode:</strong> Found the perfect angle? Pause the action and use the built-in photo mode to capture the minimalist beauty of your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.poster.avif?t=1771595233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.webm?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.mp4?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Just Balls</i></strong> is a solo developer passion project, born from a love for pure, satisfying gameplay and the sensation of flight. I hope you find as much joy and flow in playing it as I have in creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.poster.avif?t=1771595233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.webm?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.mp4?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037610?t=1771595233","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/aa6a31d737450609bf11cf7cdc327474ada2b5cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771595233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/cbfa559ae15738cf4362fd2358e4ee86d9743f66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771595233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/cbfa559ae15738cf4362fd2358e4ee86d9743f66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771595233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is no princess to save, nor dragon to