e dozens of handcrafted, abstract levels across distinct worlds\u2014from serene floating architecture to complex underwater mazes featuring custom buoyancy and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgiving Platforming:</strong> Missed a jump? There are no punishing game-overs. The world is built with safety nets and lower platforms to catch your fall, allowing you to dust yourself off and launch right back into the sky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Layered Audio Guide:</strong> Let the music lead the way. An interactive, dynamic soundtrack builds in intensity as you draw closer to your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Elements:</strong> Launch off bounce pads, ride massive ramps for speed, float upward on streams of bubbles, and navigate moving platforms at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo Mode:</strong> Found the perfect angle? Pause the action and use the built-in photo mode to capture the minimalist beauty of your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.poster.avif?t=1771595233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.webm?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.mp4?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Just Balls</i></strong> is a solo developer passion project, born from a love for pure, satisfying gameplay and the sensation of flight. I hope you find as much joy and flow in playing it as I have in creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.poster.avif?t=1771595233\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.webm?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.mp4?t=1771595233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Chris Martin Ink"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/e655d9c6256caf5db9d3e334554006063367779e/header.jpg?t=1771595233","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037610/729864570/ef405ab7dc8530e91c1cfb0a74a9093cae322ba2/1759003483/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759177841","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037610/729864570/ef405ab7dc8530e91c1cfb0a74a9093cae322ba2/1759003483/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759177841","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037610/729864570/ef405ab7dc8530e91c1cfb0a74a9093cae322ba2/1759003483/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759177841","id":257202960,"name":"Steam Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item